<title>USA: Nat'l Westminster files $2.0 bln shelf offer.</title>
<headline>Nat'l Westminster files $2.0 bln shelf offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Westminster Bank Plc filed a shelf registration with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission on Monday for up to $2.0 billion in debt securities and dollar preference shares.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for its general business and to further strengthen its capital base, the banking group said.</p>
<p>No underwriters were listed in the filing.</p>
